        "description": "Stateless PDF parsing endpoint. Receives a base64-encoded DegreeWorks PDF,\nextracts structured degree data, and returns it as JSON. Nothing is stored\nserver-side \u2014 the client persists the result to localStorage.",
        "operationId": "parse_degree_works_api_plan_parse_post",
